Z||000000||Cliff Pennock||07-13-99||06:21 PM||||Anyone else have this problem? Over 90mph or so, my headlight doors spontaneously pop open. It always scares the crap out of me!<p>Is there a solution other than opening them as soon as you hit 80mph?
